    {
      "version": "2.4",
      "releaseNotes": "TikTocToe has a new look and a new friend.\n\n- Meet your Coach: kind, playful banter after every round, with its own hand-drawn card and a living, animated mood that matches the result.\n- Fresh hand-drawn design with a roomier, easier-to-read board.\n- Ask Siri: \"Play Tic Tac Toe\" to start a new round, or \"Ask the coach for a tip\" for quick strategy, right from your wrist.\n- Smoother Easy/Hard play, the same stats you've already built up, and a few small bug fixes.",
